---
import { EVENT_NO_PREP } from '@lib/event-landing';

/**
 * "Zum ersten Mal dabei?" — the section that has to be readable in five seconds.
 *
 * Everything here is a negation on purpose: what you do *not* need. The list is
 * the point, so it gets the visual weight and the copy around it stays short.
 */
---

<section class="section event-landing-first" aria-labelledby="erstes-mal-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="event-landing-first__layout">
      <div class="event-landing-first__intro" data-reveal-group="90">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="up">Zum ersten Mal dabei?</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="erstes-mal-title" data-reveal="blur">
          Du musst <span class="text-italic">nichts können.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="event-landing-first__text" data-reveal="up">
          Viele Männer waren vorher noch nie in einem Männerkreis. Du brauchst keine besondere Vorbereitung und keine
          Erfahrung mit Meditation, Atemarbeit oder Männergruppen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="event-landing-first__panel" data-reveal="up" data-reveal-delay="120">
        <p class="event-landing-first__panel-label">Was du mitbringen musst:</p>
        <ul class="event-landing-first__list" role="list">
          {EVENT_NO_PREP.map((item) => <li class="event-landing-first__item">{item}</li>)}
        </ul>
        <p class="event-landing-first__panel-note">Nur dich – so, wie du gerade bist.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="event-landing-first__close" data-reveal="up">
      <p>
        Und du musst auch nicht sofort über deine persönlichsten Themen sprechen. Du bestimmst selbst, was du teilst.
      </p>
      <p class="event-landing-first__accent">Zuhören ist genauso Teil des Kreises wie sprechen.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  @layer sections {
    .event-landing-first {
      background: var(--bg-secondary);
    }

    .event-landing-first__layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
      align-items: center;

      @media (width <= 900px) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .event-landing-first__text {
      max-inline-size: var(--content-max-text);
      font-size: var(--text-section-body-lg);
      line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .event-landing-first__panel {
      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
      background: var(--bg-primary);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }

    .event-landing-first__panel-label {
      margin-block-end: var(--space-sm);
      font-size: var(--text-caption);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .event-landing-first__list {
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .event-landing-first__item {
      position: relative;
      padding-block: var(--space-xs);
      padding-inline-start: 1.75rem;
      font-size: var(--text-section-body);
      line-height: var(--leading-normal);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    /* A small ring rather than a checkmark — these are things you don't need. */
    .event-landing-first__item::before {
      position: absolute;
      /* Centred on the first line box: block padding + half the line height. */
      inset-block-start: calc(var(--space-xs) + var(--leading-normal) * 0.5em);
      inset-inline-start: 0;
      inline-size: 0.625rem;
      block-size: 0.625rem;
      content: '';
      border: 1.5px solid var(--accent-primary);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }

    .event-landing-first__panel-note {
      margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text-accent);
    }

    .event-landing-first__close {
      max-inline-size: var(--content-max-wide);
      margin-block-start: var(--space-lg);
      font-size: var(--text-section-body-lg);
      line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-wrap: pretty;

      & p {
        margin-block-end: var(--space-sm);
      }
    }

    .event-landing-first__accent {
      margin-block-end: 0;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1vw, 1.75rem);
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
  }
</style>
